  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 519036928
    m_Localized: The Fall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036300873728
    m_Localized: "OFFLINE PLAYER \xB7 READY"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011072
    m_Localized: Outscore the Baseline Bot in one complete match and claim the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011073
    m_Localized: "1V1 \xB7 40-CARD DECK"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011074
    m_Localized: "01 \xB7 PLAY"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011075
    m_Localized: Play opens the two rule choices before the table.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011076
    m_Localized: NEW MATCH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011077
    m_Localized: Choose your rules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011078
    m_Localized: These are the only player choices before the match. Recommended
      defaults are already selected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011079
    m_Localized: Casa Grande and Casa Chica
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011080
    m_Localized: When on, Casa Grande scores 12 points and Casa Chica scores 10.
      When off, each scores as its Ronda.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011081
    m_Localized: "Trivil\xEDn effect"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011082
    m_Localized: "Choose whether Trivil\xEDn awards five points or wins the match
      immediately."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 328036347011083
    m_Localized: "Offline 1v1 \xB7 You vs Baseline Bot \xB7 First to 24 \xB7 Complete
      1v1 rules"
